  "body": "Information Pack: https://vltre.co/l2a5Qo\r\n\r\nCRAFTED, NOT JUST CONSTRUCTED. EXPERIENCE THE DIFFERENCE. \r\n\r\nWelcome to 14 Kiri Place, Mairangi Bay - an exclusive collection of just four architecturally designed brand-new homes, where contemporary design, quality finishes and thoughtful layouts come together to create something special. \r\n\r\nPositioned in the highly desirable Mairangi Bay and Windsor Park neighbourhood, these beautifully presented residences offer an exceptional opportunity for families, professionals, and discerning buyers looking to secure a quality new home in a sought-after North Shore location. \r\n\r\nFOUR HOMES. DIFFERENT POSSIBILITIES. ONE EXCEPTIONAL ADDRESS. \r\n\r\nWith a choice of spacious four and five-bedroom configurations, there is something to suit a variety of lifestyles. \r\n\r\nDesigned for Modern Living\r\n\r\nEach residence has been thoughtfully designed to maximise comfort, functionality and contemporary appeal, featuring:\r\n\r\n*  Four or five generously proportioned bedrooms, depending on the home\r\n*  Two stylish, fully tiled bathrooms\r\n*  Additional guest toilet downstairs\r\n*  Internal-access garage\r\n*  Designer kitchen with premium appliances and elegant stone benchtops\r\n*  Spacious open-plan living and dining areas\r\n*  Outdoor decking for relaxation and entertaining\r\n*  Contemporary architectural design and modern interiors\r\n\r\nPremium Features You'll Appreciate\r\n\r\n*  Freehold titles - no body corporate fees\r\n*  Underfloor heating for added comfort\r\n*  Designer bathrooms with contemporary finishes and feature lighting\r\n*  Air conditioning in living areas and master bedrooms\r\n*  Abundant natural light\r\n*  Quality finishes and carefully considered layouts\r\n*  Private outdoor spaces\r\n\r\nEducation Excellence - Rangitoto College Zone\r\n\r\nOne of the standout attractions is the highly sought-after Rangitoto College zone.\r\n\r\nRenowned for its academic reputation, diverse curriculum and extensive sporting, cultural and extracurricular opportunities, Rangitoto College is a major drawcard for families looking to establish themselves in this desirable North Shore location.\r\n\r\nAn opportunity to secure a brand-new home while enjoying the advantages of an established education zone.\r\n\r\nLocation, Location, Location!\r\n\r\nEnjoy the convenience of living close to:\r\n\r\n*  Rangitoto College and other established educational facilities\r\n*  Constellation Drive motorway connections\r\n*  Local shopping centres and supermarkets\r\n*  Cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities\r\n*  Beautiful North Shore beaches\r\n*  Parks, recreational facilities and lifestyle destinations\r\n\r\nA HOME TO MATCH YOUR NEXT CHAPTER\r\n\r\nWhether you're a growing family looking for extra bedrooms, upgrading to a modern home or searching for a quality property in a desirable location, 14 Kiri Place deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nWith only four homes available, this is a limited opportunity to secure a brand-new residence in a sought-after North Shore neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nDon't settle for the standard. Elevate your lifestyle. Own something exceptional!\r\n\r\n14 Kiri Place, Mairangi Bay, Auckland\r\n\r\nContact ShaneM today to explore these exceptional new homes and arrange your private viewing.\r\n\r\nShaneM | Real Estate Brokers Ltd\r\nLicensed REAA 2008\r\n\r\n\r\nPLEASE NOTE: Specified floor and land area sizes have been obtained from sources such as Property Guru, Auckland Council (LIM) or Title documents. They have not been measured by the Salesperson or The WORX Real Estate / Real Estate Brokers Limited. We recommend you seek your own independent legal advice if these sizes are material to your purchasing decision.",
